   "text": "The villous features raise the possibility of a hydatidiform mole. p57KIP2 immunohistochemistry and ploidy analysis or molecular genotyping are suggested to confirm or exclude the diagnosis. If a mole is confirmed, serial serum hCG monitoring and referral to the trophoblastic disease service are recommended."
